#: ../../../hwmon/max20830.rst:22
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../../hwmon/max20830.rst:24
msgid ""
"This driver supports hardware monitoring for Analog Devices MAX20830 Step-"
"Down Switching Regulator with PMBus Interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/max20830.rst:27
msgid ""
"The MAX20830 is a 2.7V to 16V, 30A fully integrated step-down DC-DC "
"switching regulator. Through the PMBus interface, the device can monitor "
"input/output voltages, output current and temperature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../hwmon/max20830.rst:31
msgid ""
"The driver is a client driver to the core PMBus driver. Please see "
"Documentation/hwmon/pmbus.rst for details on PMBus client drivers."
msgstr ""

